# Rendered map images: 32MB, fully deterministic from the pinned submodule
# (tools/porymap/Render.py regenerates all 966 in ~22s). Not committed pending a
# call on repo size vs build-time regeneration -- see DATA-AUDIT Q17.
public/maps/*.png

# Extracted sprites: 1,646 PNGs, ~1.2MB, same deal as the map images above. Derived
# binaries that tools/sprites/Extract.py reproduces byte-identically from the pinned
# submodule, so committing them would just add a second copy to re-diff on every re-pin.
public/sprites/*/*.png
